      "change_kind": "implementation",
      "behavior": "The previously disabled manage scheduled jobs action opens an owned scheduled-work review backed by actual persisted queue with 27 job types. Rows retain typed selection through refresh/sorting, distinguish strict due/future counts and gate selected/all work. Captured selected Clear affects due and future only those types. A serial background actor drives existing physical runners using the configured importer, persisted cancellable toaster and five-second finish, with cancellation between files/shared physical lease. Integrity redownloads create/reuse the named unselected URL-import page and feed actual durable importer requests. Weak exact child/Main ownership refuses hidden/stale/rebound input and stops accepted work at next boundary on accepted exit or last Bound drop. Same-owner Clear/Refresh now run between batches, pre-work gauge is genuine, ordinary contended passes defer and each URL dispatch is independent. Partial remains for Refresh during a physical batch, independent-process Clear/full-pass lease granularity and waiting-job publication timing.",
